  step,dige:52167932a259cb79
  step=2,dige:287488c201a6e4a9,desc:the machine stands
    Assertion:machine-stood,sentence:the machine stood — an addressable self emerged on the spine
    Assertion:the-supervisor-stood,sentence:the supervisor stood — a roster of registered watches is being read
    Assertion:granted,sentence:granted — a sealed friendship holds Music grants in storage
    Assertion:a-peer-stood-reachable,sentence:a peer stood reachable — a channel opened beyond ourselves
    Assertion:a-friend-counted-their,sentence:a friend counted their shelf — records stand reachable
    Assertion:every-registered-watch-found,sentence:every registered watch found its probe — no blind spots in the roster
  step=3,dige:8f68e9913d2ed408,desc:the relay answers
    Assertion:relay-answers,sentence:the relay answers — the channel stood and frames can cross
  step=4,dige:f13d84920ca8a524,desc:who could we reach
    Assertion:possibilities-surveyed,sentence:the possibilities of peers were surveyed — every known address counted
    Assertion:the-collection-stirred,sentence:the collection stirred — real tracks wandered into the glass
  step=5,dige:d38ec5067caca9ef,desc:reach for a peer
  step=6,dige:2d2cb55d96c4a9c6,desc:does sound run here
    Assertion:the-sound-system-answered,sentence:the sound system answered — a real AudioContext ran here
    Assertion:music-from-a-friend,sentence:music from a friend played — their track streamed off their shelf over Repli
  step=7,dige:3648f5e37ac41857,desc:the music runs
    Assertion:music-runs,sentence:the music played — record chunks decoded onto the live timeline
  step=8,dige:68a76c02bc02fe79,desc:sum and report
    Assertion:report-stands,sentence:the session summed itself — a report stands ready to travel
